A '''Bubble Carriage Seal''' is a [[Spells|spell]] that creates breathable air. It is used in the [[Bubble Carriage]] [[contraption]].

==Description==
The Casting Seal contains a [[Sigils#Aeriforms|Sigil of Aeriforms]] surrounded evenly by twenty-four [[Signs#Columns|Signs of Columns]] and twenty-four [[Signs#Regions|Signs of Regions]]. The Region signs are pointing outwards, towards the ring. The sigil creates the supply of air and the signs have the generated air take on the rough shape of a bubble that persists underwater.

==Usage==
:''To see how this spell is used in relation to the contraption, see [[Bubble Carriage]]''
The spell is first seen inscribed on the roof of a Bubble Carriage coach. Upon asking about the casting seal, [[Tetia]] explains to [[Coco]] the Sigil of Aeriforms and how it differs from the [[Sigils#Wind|Sigil of Wind]].{{Ref|m|30|26}}

In [[Volume 12]], the casting seal is seen in full.{{Ref|[[Volume 12]] Extra Page: The Contraptions and Seals of Witch Hat}}

